s together in the same area, such as a list of selectable movie times, or a serie of email contacts.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Best suited for category-based filters that do not require additional visual elements.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSSuggestionChip","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents":{"images":[{"identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","type":"icon"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"Components"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"Components","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The catalog of all components provided by OUDS. It contains also "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" extensions and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifiers"},{"type":"text","text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views."}],"role":"collection"}}}